Himalayan regions of Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces. Partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the Terai regions of the country. Light rain/snowfall is likely at one or two places in the Himalayan regions of the country. Light rain/snowfall is likely at a few places in the hilly regions of the country.     "}},"sources":{"dhm_country":{"issued_at":"2026-09-30T08:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-30T12:32:37+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_city":{"issued_at":"2026-09-30T08:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-30T12:32:37+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_obs":{"issued_at":"2026-09-30T08:45:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-30T12:32:37+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_3day":{"issued_at":"2026-09-30T08:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-30T12:32:37+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_mountain":{"issued_at":"2026-09-29T18:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-30T12:32:37+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_pages":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-30T12:32:37+05:45","status":"ok"},"hyd_river":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-30T12:32:37+05:45","status":"ok"},"hyd_rain":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-30T12:32:37+05:45","status":"ok"},"model":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-30T12:32:37+05:45","status":"ok"}}}